{
  "slug": "lean",
  "name": "Lean",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Plan tasks with optimal model routing to minimize token usage. Breaks work into steps, assigns each the right model (Haiku/Sonnet/Opus), adds quality gates between stages, persists the plan to file, and reports savings after execution. Includes a companion hook for always-on model suggestions. Use /lean before complex tasks.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `lean` (Plan tasks with optimal model routing to minimize token usage).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install lean@claude-community` from `civillizard/claude-lean-skill`.\n\nA Claude Code skill that plans your tasks with the right model for each step. Decomposes work, assigns Haiku/Sonnet/Opus per step, adds quality gates between stages, and shows you exactly how much you saved.",
